{{/* TODO: ISSUE-SIDEBAR-REF-SELECTOR: Although we proposed to remove the Issue.Ref,
> The Issue.Ref was added by Add possibility to record branch or tag information in an issue (#780)
> After 8 years, this "branch selector" does nothing more than saving the branch/tag name into database and displays it,
> or sometimes auto-close a ref-matched issue by a commit message when CloseIssuesViaCommitInAnyBranch=false.

Actually, there are still enough real users who are interested in it:
* @didim99: it is a really useful feature to specify a branch in which issue found (also: https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/32744)
* @AliceLafox: https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/39746
* @mscott-smartuq, @r10r, @@chklemenz, @Smithor, @@JanJurik: https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/35505
* Forum: https://forum.gitea.com/t/alternative-to-github-for-reporting-bugs/11684
So we still keep it and mainain it.

Still needs to figure out:
* Could the "recording branch/tag name" be replaced by other approaches?
	* Write the branch name in the issue title/body then it will still be displayed, eg: `[bug] (fix/ui-broken-bug) there is a bug ....`
* Is "GitHub-like development sidebar (`#31899`)" good enough (or better) for your usage?
*/}}
{{if and (not .Issue.IsPull) (not .PageIsComparePull)}}
{{$canChangeRef := or .IsIssuePoster .HasIssuesOrPullsWritePermission}}
<div class="dropdown-container select-branch" data-kind="select"
	{{if and .Issue $canChangeRef}}data-url-update-issueref="{{$.RepoLink}}/issues/{{.Issue.Index}}/ref"{{end}}
>
	<button type="button" class="dropdown-trigger dropdown-button-inline ui button branch-dropdown-button tw-max-w-full" {{if not $canChangeRef}}disabled{{end}}>
		<span class="dropdown-text gt-ellipsis tw-text-text" data-placeholder="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "repo.issues.no_ref"}}">{{if .Reference}}{{$.RefEndName}}{{else}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "repo.issues.no_ref"}}{{end}}</span>
		{{if $canChangeRef}}{{svg "octicon-triangle-down" 14}}{{end}}
	</button>
	<input class="dropdown-value" name="ref" type="hidden" value="{{.Reference}}">
	<div class="dropdown-popup issue-branch-popup">
		<div class="ui icon search input">
			<i class="icon">{{svg "octicon-filter" 16}}</i>
			<input class="dropdown-filter" type="text" placeholder="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "repo.filter_branch_and_tag"}}...">
		</div>
		<div class="branch-tag-tab">
			<button type="button" class="btn branch-tag-item active" data-target=".branch-list">
				{{svg "octicon-git-branch" 16 "tw-mr-1"}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "repo.branches"}}
			</button>
			<button type="button" class="btn branch-tag-item" data-target=".tag-list">
				{{svg "octicon-tag" 16 "tw-mr-1"}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "repo.tags"}}
			</button>
		</div>
		<div class="dropdown-divider branch-tag-divider"></div>
		<div class="reference-list-menu branch-list">
			{{if or .Reference (not .Issue)}}
				<div class="dropdown-item tw-text-xs" data-value="" data-text="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "repo.issues.no_ref"}}"><strong>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "repo.clear_ref"}}</strong></div>
			{{end}}
			{{range .Branches}}
				<div class="dropdown-item" data-value="refs/heads/{{.}}" title="{{.}}">{{.}}</div>
			{{end}}
		</div>
		<div class="reference-list-menu tag-list tw-hidden">
			{{if or .Reference (not .Issue)}}
				<div class="dropdown-item tw-text-xs" data-value="" data-text="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "repo.issues.no_ref"}}"><strong>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "repo.clear_ref"}}</strong></div>
			{{end}}
			{{range .Tags}}
				<div class="dropdown-item" data-value="refs/tags/{{.}}" data-text="tags/{{.}}">{{.}}</div>
			{{end}}
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="divider"></div>
{{end}}
